{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fine tuned network model verification fine tuned network model verification","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md","fileName":"Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 18:30\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI-Assisted Network Automation]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted Network Automation","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fine tuned network model verification fine tuned network model verification","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md","fileName":"Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification","heading":"Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A fine-tuned network model should be tested with prompts that were not present in its training file. Verification asks whether the model follows the learned style while adapting correct values to the new case, rather than memorizing a configuration and inventing missing details.\n\nThe book's example exposes a key failure mode: consistent training data can lead a model to infer an interface address or router ID that the test prompt never supplied. Fine-tuning therefore narrows behavior but does not establish truth. Generated syntax, addresses, and assumptions require comparison with the requested inputs and authoritative network data.","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted Network Automation","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"fine tuned network model verification fine tuned network model verification","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md","fileName":"Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Fine-Tuned Network Model Verification","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[ainetworkingcookbook.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["AI-Assisted Network Automation","ainetworkingcookbook.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}